<p>EDIT: I forgot to mention that the portrait of Sophie Germain used is a public domain image. Relevant link from Wikimedia Commons <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Sophie_Germain#/media/File:Germain.jpeg">here</a> and source <a href="http://www-history.mcs.st-andrews.ac.uk/PictDisplay/Germain.html">here</a>.</p>

