<p>If you want containment handled by researchers without the proper background, then there should be explanations, but they should also be tailored to those researchers. Comparing with other articles, some give explanations of technical details in layman's terms (because this is not a website geared towards people with science degrees), while others forgo them completely, leaving the reader to exercise their Google-fu.</p>
<p>In other words, this is a good idea, but whatever you do, it's the presentation that matters most.</p>

